```sql
CREATE TABLE candidates(id INTEGER);
CREATE TABLE blocked(id INTEGER);
INSERT INTO candidates VALUES(1),(2),(NULL);
INSERT INTO blocked VALUES(2),(NULL);
SELECT c.id
FROM candidates AS c
WHERE NOT EXISTS (SELECT 1 FROM blocked AS b WHERE b.id=c.id)
ORDER BY c.id;
```
The result contains NULL and 1, ordered with NULL first in SQLite’s ascending order. Candidate 2 has a match and is excluded.

```sql
